  "description": "Before applying for admission to the program, a student must have completed three studio art courses in college. Application forms and information on requirements for admission are available in the department office. Submit applications by the first Wednesday in October or the first Wednesday in March. A student wishing to obtain a BFA degree in art must successfully complete 120 semester hours, the regular liberal arts core requirements, and a prescribed program of concentration. Overlap Policy This program may not be combined with any other studio art or graphic design major or minor.",
